* From {{ltc-l|焅|dry, hot air}} ({{zh-ref|Chan, 1995}}; {{zh-ref|Chan, 1998}}).
* From {{ltc-l|熇|hot; blazing}} ({{zh-ref|Zhan and Qiu, 2003}}).
