===Definitions===
{{head|zh|hanzi}}

# {{lb|zh|obs-std}} {{zh-original|燃|to burn}}
#* {{zh-x|凡 有 四端 於 我 者，知 皆 擴 而 充 之 矣，若 火 之 始 然，泉 之 始 達。|Since all men have these four principles in themselves, let them know to give them all their development and completion, and the issue will be like that of fire which has begun to '''burn''', or that of a spring which has begun to find vent.|ref=Mengzi}}
# {{lb|zh|obs-std}} {{ng|a demonstrative that refers to a previous verbal clause}}
#: {{par|zh|是}}
## {{lb|zh|obs-std}} [[so]]; [[thus]]; in [[this]] [[manner]]; [[like]] this
##: {{zh-x|然後|then {{qlit|after things turn out this way}}}}
##: {{zh-x|不然|or else, otherwise {{qlit|not so}}}}
##: {{zh-x|非 然 也。|It is not so. / That is not how it is.|CL}} {{attention|zh|please check}}
##* {{zh-x|子 曰：「何 必 ^高 ^宗，古 之 人 皆 然。」|The Master said, "Why must Gao Zong be referred to as an example of this? The ancients were all '''like this'''.|ref=Analects}}
## {{lb|zh|obs-std}} {{n-g|Suffix forming adverbs, sometimes also adjectives, with an abstract meaning of “in the manner of, like”.}}
##: {{zh-x|顯然|apparently, obviously}}
##: {{zh-x|果然|as expected {{qlit|as a result}}}}
##: {{zh-x|龐然大物|giant, something enormous {{qlit|a bigly big thing}}}}
##: {{zh-x|喟然長嘆|to sigh (with 喟 being an onomatopoeia)}}
# {{lb|zh|obs-std}} {{ng|metaphors extracted from fossilizations of sense 2}}
## {{lb|zh|obs-std}} [[but]]
##: {{zh-x|然而|but {{qlit|(having said) '''that''', and/but}}}}
##* {{zh-x|吾 不能 早 用 子，今 急 而 求 子，是 寡人 之 過 也。然 ^鄭 亡，子 亦 有 不利 焉。|That I was not able to employ you earlier, and now beg your help in my straits, I acknowledge to be my fault. But if Zheng perish, you also will suffer loss.|ref=Zuozhuan}}
## {{lb|zh|obs-std}} [[correct]]; [[right]]
##: {{zh-x|不以為然|to not regard as '''correct''' {{qlit|not regarding (reality) as (being) '''that'''}}; to object}}
##* {{zh-x|子 曰：「^雍 之 言 然。」| The Master said, "Yong's words are '''right'''."|ref=Analects}}
## {{lb|zh|obs-std}} to [[regard]] as [[correct]]; to [[agree]]
##* {{zh-x|^沛.公 然 其 計，從 之。|Liu Bang '''agreed''' with his plan and followed it.|ref=Shiji}}
# {{lb|zh|Teochew}} to [[resemble]]; to be [[like]]

====Usage notes====
This word is fossilized and cannot be used to form new expressions in Modern Chinese. In earlier Chinese, it could freely refer to any verb clause.
